[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":233},["ShallowReactive",2],{"kxhA7MIcxWGr3teRKDbU6Qc8-KLw_pHNl8aHM1unYto":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":43,"sector":44,"services":48,"introCopy":49,"storyblockAccordions":50,"storyblockAssets":60,"flexibleContent":84,"footerLinkLabel":225,"footerLinks":226},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"The Office Group","Shed revitalized The Office Group’s historic buildings, blending Golden Age grandeur with modern elegance—creating a timeless, impressive office space.",null,"the-office-group",false,{"hex":11},"#FFFFFF",{"hex":13},"#1C1C1C","Let the building lead the way, a heritage response to bolster TOG’s design-led co-working portfolio.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>The Office\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Group\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":33},900,"",1600,{"width":32,"height":34,"url":35,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":36},917,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1737991456-shed_tog_marylebone_16.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":37,"srcSet":38,"src":39,"width":40,"height":41,"sizes":42},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1737991456-shed_tog_marylebone_16.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1737991456-shed_tog_marylebone_16.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1737991456-shed_tog_marylebone_16.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1737991456-shed_tog_marylebone_16.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1737991456-shed_tog_marylebone_16.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1737991456-shed_tog_marylebone_16.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1737991456-shed_tog_marylebone_16.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",3200,1834,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Various London: Victoria Station Melcombe Place Greville St.",[45],{"slug":46,"label":47},"workplace","Workplace","Interior Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE2Mjg3NDM4MjgsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>The Office Group entrusted Shed with a suite of historic buildings in need of new life. The approach was to capture the relaxed grandeur of The Golden Age of Travel, harnessing the classicism and charm of the existing buildings, with a fresh contemporary edge fit for any burgeoning young business wishing to impress.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[51,54,57],{"title":52,"copy":53},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE4NDYzNzY2MTksImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>The brief was to implement TOG&rsquo;s tried and tested formula of co-working club spaces, rentable offices and meeting rooms across three locations in prestigious travel hubs:\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Victoria Station - Belle House.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Marylebone station - Melcombe Place\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Farringdon - Greville St.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":55,"copy":56},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE2ODc5MDYxNTgsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>Capture the relaxed grandeur and elegance of The Golden Age of Travel. An approach befitting the classicism and heritage of the existing buildings. Create an interior that takes you to a world of a bygone era, with a fresh contemporary edge fit for a modern workplace.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":58,"copy":59},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE0MDk1MzQ2NTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>Shed responded and reinstated all the charm and character the existing buildings had to offer, making sure it was an integral part of the scheme. All the FF&amp;E was designed and procured by Shed. Pairing contemporary layers with rich detailing and stand out art deco pieces. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[61,71,81],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":62},{"width":63,"height":64,"url":65,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":66},2094,1